OL,3,GNEWSAGovernors urge States to ringfence
OL,4,A#2.2m grants
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchool governors in Guernsey have
OL,7,Fcalled on the States to keep #2.2m a
OL,8,Fyear within the education budget if a
OL,9,Fproposed philanthropic gift to
OL,10,FElizabeth College and The Ladies'
OL,11,FCollege goes ahead.
OL,13,FThe donation, announced by the private
OL,14,Fcolleges, would allow them to give up
OL,15,Ftheir annual States grant worth about
OL,16,F#2.2m, the schools have said.
OL,18,FThe colleges said the funding could
OL,19,Falso support bursaries, sport, creative
OL,20,Farts projects and the development of an
OL,21,Fisland-wide AI and Innovation Hub.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
