OL,3,GNEWSAGovernors urge States to ringfence
OL,4,A#2.2m grants
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chairs of governance boards
OL,7,Frepresenting States-maintained and
OL,8,Fvoluntary schools said they welcomed
OL,9,Fthe proposal and its potential benefits
OL,10,Ffor young people across Guernsey.
